          <rules>
            <rule name="Lady Death" id="b459-654c-3329-a4cc" hidden="false">
              <description>When Lieutenant Lyudmila Pavlichenko deals damage to a Vehicle Unit with a Commander Mounted, if she deals 7 or more damage, remove that Commander from the Vehicle, they are destroyed. The Attacked Vehicle retains Veteran Crew even if the Commander is removed. If Lieutenant Lyudmila Pavlichenko is your Field Commander, when a Unit in your Army attacks with a Weapon with Critical Shot, it triggers on a 9 or 10.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
