          <rules>
            <rule name="Businka and Kroshka" id="c0b8-0c5e-2ce7-a0fc" hidden="false">
              <description>Once per Activation, select an Enemy Unit within 18&quot; and LOS, then place the tokens for Businka and Kroshka in base-to-base contact with that Unit. While those tokens are applied, that Unit is Immobilized; its EV is lowered by 2, and it may not choose to perform any Movement Actions. The tokens remain applied while this Unit is within 18&quot; and LOS of them.</description>
            </rule>
            <rule name="Alaskan Boyar" id="beef-8f8b-01cd-ec3f" hidden="false">
              <description>Countess Aleksandra Razumovsky must be your Field Commander. Countess Aleksandra Razumovsky may only be taken if your selected Army Specialization is Alaskan Defense Corps 17th Division.

Each time you lose a Victory Point, your opponent must roll a Check where the score is 4 plus the amount of VP you have lost; on failure, they also lose a Victory Point.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
