          <rules>
            <rule name="The Punishment of God" id="d6dd-6f75-a348-dc6e" hidden="false">
              <description>Weapons equipped to Cavalry Units in this Army are considered to have the Suppressive Special Rule. Each time an Enemy Fortification is destroyed, gain 1 SP.</description>
            </rule>
            <rule name="Dust Off" id="0b07-fef1-f7f9-059e" hidden="false">
              <description>After an Attack Action is resolved in which Sergeltiin Khan&apos;s Mounted Model is reduced to 0 HP, replace it with his On-Foot Model. This model&apos;s HP is reset to its original value, its EV is set to 6, and its MV is set to 6&quot;. This Unit loses the Cavalry Keyword and gains the Troop Keyword.</description>
            </rule>
            <rule name="Khagan" id="c17b-3731-b749-efee" hidden="false">
              <description>Sergeltiin Khan must be your Field Commander. Sergeltiin Khan may only be taken in this Army if your specialization is 1st Kheshig Mounted Guard Division (New Khanate).This Unit may reroll 1s on all Checks.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
