              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
          <rules>
            <rule name="Exaposteilarion" id="48e2-253b-b925-1a16" hidden="false">
              <description>Whenever this Unit performs the Patch-Up Action. Each Friendly Unit within 12” and LOS may choose one of the following: 
* Remove a Suppression Token.
* Gain an Aim Token.
* Gain an Order Token.</description>
            </rule>
            <rule name="Healing Touch" id="6ec7-9957-5a51-448a" hidden="false">
              <description>This Unit may perform the Patch Up Action any number of times each Round. (These are not Free Actions, you must still spend Actions to do so)</description>
            </rule>
            <rule name="Man of the Cloth" id="e757-f2c3-b8c9-ba2b" hidden="false">
              <description>Hieromonk Nikon Lazarev may not be your Field Commander. Hieromonk Nikon Lazarev may only be taken if your selected Army Specialization is 12th Ural Motor-Rifle Division (Nastyeviks).

Each time a Unit in this Army performs Last Rites, this Unit must immediately perform a Free Patch-Up Action targeting the closest eligible damaged Unit. This Unit may perform the Patch-Up Action on both Friendly and Enemy Units.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
          <selectionEntries>
            <selectionEntry name="Hieromonk Nikon Lazarev" id="5526-d77f-e8eb-9c9a" hidden="false" import="true" type="model">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="3d79-3780-dd25-80b2-min" field="selections" includeChildSelections="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="min" value="1"/>
