            <rule name="Railhead" id="fdb1-7091-984a-ad49" hidden="false">
              <description>During Deployment, place a Railhead Fortification fully within your Deployment Zone. This section and all pieces connected to it form a Rail Network. Once you have placed the Railhead and all Rail Sections, place this Unit on the Rail Network.


When this Unit Moves, it may only move forwards or backwards along the Rail Network. Rail Segments may not be Destroyed if a (CORE) Rail Unit is on top of them.


Additional Rail Segments may be built by Engineer Units at the cost of 2SP per Rail Segment.</description>
            </rule>
