          <rules>
            <rule name="Flatbed" id="ac9e-0287-80f1-8bb8" hidden="false">
              <description>Once per Game, during this Model&apos;s activation, as a Difficult Action, you may Unload Cargo, if you do, select a Destroyed Vehicle in your Army. At a cost of 1SP for every 5 Maximum HP that Unit has, you may redeploy it at full HP within 4&quot; of this Unit.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
